    "name": {
      "value": "Trick Driver"
    },
    "source": {
      "value": "g&g"
    },
    "description": {
      "value": "While cavaliers follow an old and tired tradition of mounted combat, you take a more modern road. Through aggressive use of vehicles, you roll across the battlefield, taking down your opponents. You go beyond simply operating a vehicle, pushing it to perform stunts that its builders never intended, transforming the vehicle into something much greater than a mere conveyance."
    },
